@startuml j6-qr-and-statement
!include c4-sequence.iuml
title J6 UPI QR code and statement
actor "Owner" as O <<person>>
box "Hisaab in the browser"
participant "Customer page\n(app.js)" as C <<container>>
participant "QR library\n(vendor/qrcode.min.js)" as Q <<component>>
participant "Shop profile\n(profile.js)" as F <<component>>
end box
participant "Browser's\nprint window" as B <<external>>
actor "Customer" as K <<person>>
participant "UPI app" as U <<external>>
O -> C : tap a customer in the list
C --> O : name, "Balance", "Entries, newest first"\nwith "Balance after" on each,\nand "Balance over time"
== Scan to pay ==
O -> C : tap "UPI QR code"
C -> Q : load the QR library from\nthe site itself, the first time
note right of Q : served by the site, not a CDN,\nso the code still draws offline
C --> O : the QR code with the amount,\nthe UPI ID and "Scan with\nany UPI app to pay {shop}."
K -> U : scan the code;\nthe UPI app opens\nwith the amount filled in
== Statement ==
O -> C : tap "Statement (PDF)"
opt the profile has a logo, owner name or address
  F -> C : add the shop logo, owner name\nand address, when the profile has them
end
C -> B : "Account statement": Date, Note,\nYou gave, You got, Balance, "Totals"\nand a "Scan to pay" code when money is owed
O -> B : choose "Save as PDF" or a printer
note over C, B : the PDF is made by the browser's\nown print window; nothing is uploaded
@enduml
